  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> </span><span data-teams=\"true\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/jpsc-civil-services-pre-2026/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Jharkhand Public Service Commission (JPSC)</a> </span></span>has released the answer key for the recruitment of Combined Civil Services Examination. This recruitment was released for 103 posts. Applications for the JPSC Civil Services Pre Recruitment 2026 were accepted from February 26, 2026, to March 09, 2026. The online examination was held on 19 April 2026. Candidates who appeared for this examination can download their JPSC Civil Services Pre Answer Key 2026 from the link given below.</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Jharkhand Public Service Commission (JPSC)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">JPSC Civil Services Pre Admit Card 2026</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">JPSC Pre Advt No. : 01/2026</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>31 January 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><spa